  "notes": "The defense starts with 3 rounds of hearts. South is forced to ruff as the ♦A must be lost. If South tries to draw trump immediately, he may go down when trumps break 4-2.\n\nSouth cannot draw 4 rounds of trump because that would also exhaust his own trump supply. The defense might be able to cash hearts when they win the ♦A.\n\nDrawing 2 or 3 rounds of trump before playing on diamonds could be equally fatal. Not only does a defensive diamond ruff become possible, but West may be able to win the ♦A and make South ruff another heart. East will have more trumps than South and the contract will fail.\n\nSouth should not draw trump at all before attacking diamonds. If the defense persists in hearts, North's trumps can take care of the ruff. South can draw all the outstanding trumps and take the balance.",
  "commentary_paragraphs": [
    "The defense starts with 3 rounds of hearts. South is forced to ruff as the ♦A must be lost. If South tries to draw trump immediately, he may go down when trumps break 4-2.",
    "South cannot draw 4 rounds of trump because that would also exhaust his own trump supply. The defense might be able to cash hearts when they win the ♦A.",
    "Drawing 2 or 3 rounds of trump before playing on diamonds could be equally fatal. Not only does a defensive diamond ruff become possible, but West may be able to win the ♦A and make South ruff another heart. East will have more trumps than South and the contract will fail.",
    "South should not draw trump at all before attacking diamonds. If the defense persists in hearts, North's trumps can take care of the ruff. South can draw all the outstanding trumps and take the balance."
  ],
